  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A training programme for 28 experts from Russian central and regional authorities managing traffic safety and environment issues in transport planning to study the Swedish implementation of measures taken to reduce emissions, noise and other negative factors in the traffic environment and to improve traffic safety.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">En tv&#xe5;veckorskurs i Sverige f&#xf6;r 28 deltagare, rekryterade fr&#xe5;n Moskva och regionerna. Avsikten &#xe4;r att kursdeltagarna sj&#xe4;lvst&#xe4;ndigt skall arbeta fram en dokumentation som inneh&#xe5;ller en plan f&#xf6;r hur en effektivare stadsplanering skall kunna &#xe5;stadkomma en skonsammare trafikmilj&#xf6;.</narrative>
  </description>
